# Local development + build-time env for the web frontend.
# Copy this to `.env.local` and fill in your own AMap JS API values.
# `.env.local` is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# VITE_AMAP_KEY: your AMap (Gaode) JS API key (高德开放平台 Web端(JS API) key).
# VITE_AMAP_SECURITY_JS_CODE: the corresponding securityJsCode for your key.
# Get both at https://console.amap.com/ -> 应用管理 -> 我的应用 -> 创建应用 -> Web端(JS API).
VITE_AMAP_KEY="your_amap_js_api_key"
VITE_AMAP_SECURITY_JS_CODE="your_amap_security_js_code"
